==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|лѣни́вый||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|лѣнивꙑи}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*lěnivъ||lazy, sluggish}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*lěniti}} + {{m|sla-pro|*-ivъ}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*lěniti}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*lěnь}} / {{m|sla-pro|*lěnjь||laziness}} or {{m|sla-pro|*lěnъ||lazy, slow}}. {{surf|ru|лень|-и́вый}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|лени́вый}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ленивый.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|лени́вый|+|peri,лениве́йший|dim=лени́венький|intens=прелени́вый|adv=лени́во|absn=лень,+}}

# [[lazy]] (unwilling to work)
#: {{ant|ru|приле́жный}}

